@host = http://localhost:8000

### Speech-to-Text
POST {{host}}/speech-to-text
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="audio.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./sample.wav
------Boundary--

### Text-to-Speech
POST {{host}}/text-to-speech?text=Hello%20world

### Full Pipeline (returns JSON with transcript + AI response + audio URL)
POST {{host}}/pipeline
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="audio.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./sample.wav
------Boundary--

### Pipeline Stream (returns audio directly)
POST {{host}}/pipeline/stream
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="audio.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./sample.wav
------Boundary--
